ketio-next: one registry of ",[143,144,145],"strong",{},"named clients"," that Rust and the webviews share.",[148,149,150,158,190],"ul",{},[151,152,153,154,157],"li",{},"Rust connects clients through the plugin, or registers clients it built itself (for example in core code that must not depend on Tauri), optionally ",[143,155,156],{},"read-only"," for the webview.",[151,159,160,161,164,165,168,169,172,173,172,176,179,180,179,183,179,186,189],{},"JS connects its own clients (",[138,162,163],{},"connect",") or attaches to registered ones (",[138,166,167],{},"attach",") with an API close to socket.io-client: ",[138,170,171],{},"emit",", ",[138,174,175],{},"emitWithAck",[138,177,178],{},"on"," \u002F ",[138,181,182],{},"once",[138,184,185],{},"off",[138,187,188],{},"onAny",", acks for server callbacks, binary anywhere in the arguments.",[151,191,192],{},"Events and state transitions go to each webview over its own IPC channel, in order, filtered by event name if asked. Subscriptions end when the webview reloads or closes.",[135,194,195],{},"The socket runs in Rust: no CORS, no browser websocket limits, TLS through rustls (or the platform library), and the connection survives page reloads.",[197,198,200],"h2",{"id":199},"install","Install",[202,203,209],"pre",{"className":204,"code":205,"filename":206,"language":207,"meta":208,"style":208},"language-toml shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","[dependencies]\ntauri-plugin-socketio = \"0.1\"\n","src-tauri\u002FCargo.toml","toml","",[138,210,211,227],{"__ignoreMap":208},[212,213,216,220,224],"span",{"class":214,"line":215},"line",1,[212,217,219],{"class":218},"sMK4o","[",[212,221,223],{"class":222},"sBMFI","dependencies",[212,225,226],{"class":218},"]\n",[212,228,230,234,237,240,244],{"class":214,"line":229},2,[212,231,233],{"class":232},"sTEyZ","tauri-plugin-socketio ",[212,235,236],{"class":218},"=",[212,238,239],{"class":218}," \"",[212,241,243],{"class":242},"sfazB","0.1",[2